"existing user-meta content.<br>Any unused Foodle field names with still "
"existing data are identified for recovery!<br><span style='color:darkred;'>"
"However, you must take extreme special care when using such<br>existing user "
"metafields as the results may not be foreseeable!</span><br><br><strong>"
"Whether own or existing metafield:</strong><br>The metafield name will be "
"displayed as field title in the user profile.<br>Sorting is always done in "
"the same order as the fields are defined in this table!"
