#: foodle-for-democracy-poll.php:564
#| msgid ""
#| "Decide whether administrators shall really be considered to be part of "
#| "the pool of voters (bar graph),<br>even if they are selected (left). By "
#| "this, you can e.g. control the visibility without being 'in the game'.<br>"
#| "<strong>Remark: Additional control through Foodle's 'Special Roles & "
#| "Users' tab (reminders)</strong>."
msgid ""
"Decide whether administrators shall really be considered to be part of the "
"pool of voters (bar graph / voting)<br>when they are selected (left). By "
"this, you can e.g. control the visibility without being 'in the game'.<br>"
"<strong>Remark: Additional control through Foodle's 'Special Roles & Users' "
"tab (reminders)</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Entscheide, ob Administratoren wirklich als Teil der Abstimmenden gezählt "
"werden (Bargraph / Abstimmen), wenn sie<br>ausgewählt sind (links). Dadurch "
"kannst du z.B. die Sichtbarkeit kontrollieren, ohne 'im Spiel' zu sein.<br>"
"<strong>Anmerkung: Zusätzliche Kontrolle durch den Tab 'Spezielle Rollen & "
"Benutzer' von Foodle (Erinnerungen)</strong>."

#: foodle-for-democracy-poll.php:536
msgid ""
"Decide whether or not to count marked voters<br>in the total sum of an "
"answer column."
msgstr ""
"Entscheide, ob ein markierter Benutzer in der<br>Summe einer Antwort-Spalte "
"gezählt wird."

#: foodle-for-democracy-poll.php:535
msgid ""
"Decide whether or not to show the \\\"refresh\\\" button in the results "
"display<br>after voting and/or before voting. When e.g. in a simultaneous "
"voting<br>situation, this would refresh the results when pressed."
msgstr ""
"Entscheide, ob der \\\"Aktualisiere\\\"-Button in der Ergebnisanzeige vor "
"und/oder<br>nach dem Abstimmen angezeigt werden soll. In einer z.B. Simultan-"
"Abstimmung<br>wird dadurch die Ergebnisanzeige bei jedem Klick aktualisiert."

#: foodle-for-democracy-poll.php:568
#| msgid ""
#| "Decide whether the roles selection will influence being able to enter new "
#| "comments.<br>Remark: The textarea for new comments must be visible (check "
#| "above the general visibility<br>of comments)."
