"Decide whether the roles selection will influence being able to enter new "
"comments.<br>Remark: The textarea for new comments must be visible (check "
"above the general<br>visibility of comments)."
msgstr ""
"Entscheide, ob die Rollenauswahl die Eingabemöglichkeit für neue Kommentare "
"beeinflusst.<br>Anmerkung: Die Textarea für neue Kommentare muss sichtbar "
"sein (prüfe oben die generelle<br>Sichtbarkeit von Kommentaren)."

#: foodle-for-democracy-poll.php:569
#| msgid ""
#| "Decide whether the roles selection will<br>influence the bar graph "
#| "visibility.<br><strong>Remark: The bar graph will only be visible<br>for "
#| "logged-in users.</strong>"
msgid ""
"Decide whether the roles selection will influence the bar graph visibility."
