#: foodle-tips.php:40 foodle-tips.php:196
msgid "The Foodle Shortcode"
msgstr "Der Foodle-Shortcode"

#: foodle-for-democracy-poll.php:1672
#| msgid ""
#| "The Foodle shortcode is used to display the poll results in various ways. "
#| "It can be used on the same page as the democracy poll shortcode and will "
#| "be have interactively (AJAX) when voting. However, it can as well be used "
#| "independently on any page or post.</p>\n"
#| "              <p>You may consult the <a href=\"/wp-admin/options-general."
#| "php?page=foodle-admin-page&tab=foodle-tips\">Tips tab</a> for shortcode "
#| "details.</p>\n"
#| "              <p>For <a href=\"/wp-admin/options-general.php?page=foodle-"
#| "admin-page&tab=special-roles-users\">selectable viewers</a>, the "
#| "shortcode provides an automated email reminder option for those who "
#| "didn't vote, yet. The email text can be edited in the <a href=\"https:"
#| "//finkenberger-net.voicesunlimited.de/wp-admin/options-general.php?"
#| "page=foodle-admin-page&tab=edit-email\">related tab</a>. Placeholders are "
#| "available to configure the email in many ways. This includes name "
#| "information of the person that will trigger the email (can be anyone of "
#| "those special viewers having access)."
msgid ""
"The Foodle shortcode is used to display the poll results in various ways. It "
"can be used on the same page as the democracy poll shortcode and will be "
"have interactively (AJAX) when voting. However, it can as well be used "
"independently on any page or post.</p>\n"
"              <p>You may consult the <a href=\"/wp-admin/options-general.php?"
"page=foodle-admin-page&tab=foodle-tips\">Tips tab</a> for shortcode details."
"</p>\n"
"              <p>For <a href=\"/wp-admin/options-general.php?page=foodle-"
"admin-page&tab=special-roles-users\">selectable viewers</a>, the shortcode "
"provides an automated email reminder option for those who didn't vote, yet. "
"The email text can be edited in the <a href=\"/wp-admin/options-general.php?"
"page=foodle-admin-page&tab=edit-email\">related tab</a>. Placeholders are "
"available to configure the email in many ways. This includes name "
"information of the person that will trigger the email (can be anyone of "
"those special viewers having access)."
msgstr ""
"Der Foodle-Shortcode wird benutzt, um die Umfrageergebnisse auf vielfältige "
"Weise anzuzeigen. Er kann auf derselben Seite, wie der Democracy-Poll-"
"Shortcode benutzt werden und verhält sich interaktiv (AJAX) beim Abstimmen. "
"Allerdings kann er auch unabhängig davon auf jeder Seite und jedem Post "
"verwendet werden.</p>\n"
"              <p>Du kannst den <a href=\"/wp-admin/options-general.php?"
"page=foodle-admin-page&tab=foodle-tips\">Tipps-Tab</a> für Sportcode-Details "
"zu Rate ziehen.</p>\n"
"              <p>Für <a href=\"/wp-admin/options-general.php?page=foodle-"
"admin-page&tab=special-roles-users\">auswählbare Benutzer</a> mit Anzeige-"
"Berechtigung stellt der Shortcode eine E-Mail-Erinnerungsfunktion an "
"diejenigen bereit, die noch nicht abgestimmt haben. Der Text der E-Mail kann "
"im <a href=\"/wp-admin/options-general.php?page=foodle-admin-page&tab=edit-"
"email\">entsprechenden Tab</a> bearbeitet werden. Es sind Platzhalter "
"verfügbar, um die E-Mail frei gestalten zu können. Diese schließen auch "
"Informationen zu der Person ein, welche die E-Mail 'triggert' (dies kann "
"jeder sein, der hierfür die Anzeige-Berechtigung hat)."

