#: foodle-tips.php:108
#| msgid ""
#| "This plugin can be used by any organization, association, union, society, "
#| "club or group of people when polls shall be executed and results be "
#| "displayed in a structured way, e.g.:<ul style=\"margin:0px 0px 13px 26px; "
#| "list-style-type:disc;\"><li>For this or that choir rehearsal or planned "
#| "public event to be scheduled, would sufficient Sopranos 1 or Tenors 2 be "
#| "available?</li><li>Or do the choir members support this or that idea and "
#| "from which sub-group do they come from?</li><li>Or what could be winning "
#| "ideas for the next concert stage dress (Democracy Poll with answers to be "
#| "brought by the voters and be displayed for everyone easy to understand) "
#| "and would this spread nicely in color on stage, considering the choir's "
#| "stage order?</li></ul>You will surely translate all this into your own "
#| "environment and your own needs..."
msgid ""
"This plugin can be used by any organization, association, union, society, "
"club or group of people when polls shall be executed and results be "
"displayed in a structured way, e.g.:\n"
"      <ul class=\"foodle-ul\">\n"
"        <li>For this or that choir rehearsal or planned public event to be "
"scheduled, would sufficient Sopranos 1 or Tenors 2 be available?</li>\n"
"        <li>Or do the choir members support this or that idea and from which "
"sub-group do they come from?</li>\n"
"        <li>Or what could be winning ideas for the next concert stage dress "
"(Democracy Poll with answers to be brought by the voters and be displayed "
"for everyone easy to understand) and would this spread nicely in color on "
"stage, considering the choir's stage order?</li>\n"
"        <li>...you will surely translate all this into your own environment "
"and your own needs...</li>\n"
"      </ul>"
msgstr ""
"Dieses Plugin kann von jeder Organisation, Gesellschaft, jedem Verein oder "
"jeder Gruppe von Menschen benutzt werden, wenn Umfragen durchgeführt und "
"Ergebnisse auf strukturierte Weise angezeigt werden sollen, z.B.:\n"
"      <ul class=\"foodle-ul\">\n"
"        <li>Für diese oder jene Chorprobe bzw. zu planendes öffentliches "
"Event, wären genügend 1. Soprane oder 2. Tenöre verfügbar?</li>\n"
"        <li>Oder unterstützen die Chormitglieder diese oder jene Idee und "
"von welcher Stimmgruppe kommen sie?</li>\n"
"        <li>Oder welches könnte die beste Idee für ein neues Bühnen-Dress "
"sein (Democracy Poll mit aktivierten Benutzerantworten und übersichtlicher "
"Darstellung) und würde dies auf der Bühne farblich gut wirken, wenn man die "
"Chor-Bühnenordnung berücksichtigt?</li>\n"
"        <li>...du wirst das Ganze sicherlich auf deine eigenen Belange und "
"Bedürfnisse übertragen...</li>\n"
"      </ul>"

