msgid "will end on"
msgstr "endet am"

#: foodle-for-democracy-poll.php:2776
#| msgid ""
#| "With the help of Regular Expressions, fields can be filled automatically "
#| "in the user's profile,<br>based on future entries in the first user meta "
#| "field (even when the first field is filled using<br>drop-down). Therefore,"
#| " this option is only available for the second and further fields.<br>"
#| "However, Regular Expressions for fields will be overruled, when the same "
#| "field is defined<br>as a drop-down field for user entry!<br>(Content is "
#| "being validated partially during input and the RegExp prior submit)"
msgid ""
"With the help of Regular Expressions, fields can be filled automatically in "
"the user's profile,<br>based on future entries in the first user metafield "
"(even when the first field is filled using<br>drop-down). Therefore, this "
"option is only available for the second and further fields.<br>However, "
"Regular Expressions for fields will be overruled, when the same field is "
"defined<br>as a drop-down field for user entry!<br>(Content is being "
"validated partially during input and the RegExp prior submit)"
msgstr ""
"Mithilfe von regulären Ausdrücken können Felder im Benutzerprofil "
"automatisch auf Basis zukünftiger Einträge<br>im ersten der Meta-Felder "
"befüllt werden (selbst, wenn das erste Feld mittels Drop-Down festgelegt "
"wird).<br>Deshalb ist diese Option nur für das zweite und weitere Felder "
"verfügbar.<br>Andererseits gilt: Reguläre Ausdrücke für ein Feld werden "
"ignoriert, wenn das Feld selbst als Drop-Down definiert ist.<br>(Der Inhalt "
"wird teilweise während der Eingabe validiert, der reguläre Ausdruck vor dem "
"Senden)"

#: foodle-for-democracy-poll.php:4098
#| msgid ""
#| "With this comma-separated list of IDs, you may determine all pages and/or "
#| "posts where<br>the Foodle table's interactive AJAX shall be switched off. "
#| "This could become necessary<br>to avoid conflicts, e.g. when more than "
#| "one Foodle shortcode is present.<br>(Content is being validated during "
#| "input)<br><span style='color:DarkGoldenrod;'>This settings line will "
#| "remain an administrator priviledge!</span>"
msgid ""
"With this comma-separated list of IDs, you may determine all pages and/or "
"posts where<br>the Foodle table's interactive AJAX shall be switched off. "
"This could become necessary<br>to avoid conflicts, e.g. when more than one "
"Foodle shortcode is present.<br>(Content is being validated during input)<br>"
"<span style='color:DarkGoldenrod;'>This settings line will remain an "
"administrator privilege!</span>"
msgstr ""
"Mit dieser komma-separierten ID-Liste kannst du alle Seiten oder Posts "
"festlegen, auf denen<br>das interaktive AJAX der Foodle-Tabelle abgeschaltet "
"wird. Dies kann notwendig werden,<br>um Konflikte zu vermeiden, z.B. wenn "
"mehr als ein Foodle-Shortcode dort vorhanden ist.<br>(Der Inhalt wird "
"während der Eingabe validiert)<br><span style='color:DarkGoldenrod;'>Diese "
"Einstellungszeile bleibt das Privileg eines Administrators!</span>"

